        <headline>Small Craft Advisory issued September 24 at 6:33PM EDT until September 26 at 8:00AM EDT by NWS Miami FL</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...North winds 10 to 20 kt and seas 7 to 10 ft expected.

* WHERE...Coastal waters from Jupiter Inlet to Deerfield Beach
FL out 20 NM and Waters from Jupiter Inlet to Deerfield Beach
FL from 20 to 60 NM.

* WHEN...From 2 AM Friday to 8 AM EDT Saturday.

* IMPACTS...Conditions will be hazardous to small craft.
</description>
        <instruction>Inexperienced mariners, especially those operating smaller
vessels, should avoid navigating in hazardous conditions.</instruction>
